 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=blPil2GV6u8Q7kNvwH1tbT9&_nc_oc=AdptMPbqj1_GkswWeulDSJWTF86Eu-GtMomJHj0tVZEwTRb0jFfPq7C2SLVbKr3h6SA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxIhD8e1m1zvXyv8EqHbylOGcWhJKqoU3zGaFxSr5CrkA&oe=69C3CABE"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ml8Ow9yNaS0Q7kNvwGPp8n-&_nc_oc=AdpGObZmos2lE3DZ0svWUcrlvIGUCVhEHx09XSDb4uhkY5RI5lPhep4p5YF_j38qMw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxTwJbk-WPrXGZkQJgj3vzg1xp2cChiyf80ivFuSchhsg&oe=69C3C906"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_